<p><strong>Outbound notifications only.</strong> No incoming email or ticket creation. Disabled by default.</p>
<div class="box">
  <p><%= link_to 'Connect Microsoft', microsoft365_smtp_connect_path, method: :post,
                class: 'm365-connect-button', role: 'button' %>
     <%= link_to 'Connection status / disconnect', microsoft365_smtp_connection_path %></p>
  <p>Save settings first, then click Connect Microsoft to open Microsoft sign-in directly. Complete MFA/consent there. This uses the saved mailbox and does not enable delivery or send email.</p>
</div>
<style>
  .m365-connect-button { display: inline-block; background: #0067b8; color: #fff !important; padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none !important; margin-right: 12px; }
  .m365-connect-button:hover, .m365-connect-button:focus { background: #005494; outline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
<p>
  <label for="settings_enabled">Enable Microsoft 365 SMTP</label>
  <%= hidden_field_tag 'settings[enabled]', '0', id: nil %>
  <%= check_box_tag 'settings[enabled]', '1', @settings['enabled'] == '1', id: 'settings_enabled' %>
</p>
<% [['tenant_id', 'Tenant ID (GUID)'], ['client_id', 'Application / Client ID (GUID)'], ['mailbox', 'Sending mailbox'], ['sender_name', 'Sender display name']].each do |key, title| %>
  <p>
    <%= label_tag "settings_#{key}", title %>
    <%= text_field_tag "settings[#{key}]", @settings[key], id: "settings_#{key}", size: 60 %>
  </p>
<% end %>
<p>
  <%= label_tag 'settings_client_secret', 'Client secret' %>
  <%= password_field_tag 'settings[client_secret]', nil, id: 'settings_client_secret', size: 60, autocomplete: 'new-password' %>
  <em>Enter the secret Value, not its ID. Leave blank to keep the existing secret. Saved encrypted and never displayed.</em>
</p>
<p>
  <%= label_tag 'settings_clear_client_secret', 'Remove page-managed secret' %>
  <%= check_box_tag 'settings[clear_client_secret]', '1', false, id: 'settings_clear_client_secret' %>
  <em>Falls back to the server-managed secret if one is configured.</em>
</p>
<p>Page-managed secret: <strong><%= @settings['client_secret_encrypted'].to_s.empty? ? 'Not set' : 'Configured (hidden)' %></strong></p>
<p>Callback URI to register in Entra (automatic): <code><%= Paytech::RedmineMicrosoft365Smtp::Configuration.current.redirect_uri %></code></p>
<p>SMTP server, TLS, EHLO hostname and timeouts are automatic. The saved client secret is encrypted using Redmine's encryption key; encrypted-token storage remains managed on the server.</p>
<p>Save while disabled, connect Microsoft, then enable and <%= link_to 'send a test email', microsoft365_smtp_test_path %>. Application and mailbox changes require reconnecting.</p>
